{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"一、四年，春王正月，公及齊侯平莒及郯。莒人不肯，公伐莒，取向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"此平莒也，其言不肯何？辭取向也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"二、秦伯稻卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"三、夏六月乙酉，鄭公子歸生弒其君夷。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"四、赤狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"五、秋，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"六、公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_118_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_118","textTraditional":"七、冬，楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}